WEBVTT

00:05:55.792 --> 00:06:01.726
the spike of entrepreneurship
you see all throughout Asia today.

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:04.601
And if you travel through Asia today,

00:06:04.625 --> 00:06:11.184
you will also see the results
of the third revolution:

00:06:11.208 --> 00:06:15.393
the revolution of good governance.

00:06:15.417 --> 00:06:18.518
Now as a result of good governance --

00:06:18.542 --> 00:06:19.934
travel in Asia,

00:06:19.958 --> 00:06:22.101
you see better health care,

00:06:22.125 --> 00:06:24.059
better education,

00:06:24.083 --> 00:06:26.101
better infrastructure,

00:06:26.125 --> 00:06:28.268
better public policies.

00:06:28.292 --> 00:06:29.542
It's a different world.